{
  "title": "Kissed Portuguese Samphire Gratin",
  "description": "A rich and creamy gratin dish featuring crunchy samphire, infused with the nutty flavors of portuguese bread and topped with a crispy parmesan crust.",
  "cuisine": "portuguese",
