  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 180C.",
    "Trim the samphire and cut it into 2cm pieces.",
    "In a large pan, heat the olive oil over medium heat.",
    "Add the sliced onion and cook until softened, about 8 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Stir in the lemon juice, nutmeg, and black pepper. Cook for 1 minute.",
    "In a separate pan, toast the breadcrumbs until golden brown.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together the eggs, heavy cream, and grated parmesan.",
    "Add the cooked samphire mixture to the bowl and stir to combine.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a baking dish and top with the toasted breadcrumbs.",
    "Drizzle the top with additional olive oil and sprinkle with grated parmesan.",
    "Bake the gratin in the preheated oven for 20 minutes, or until golden brown and set."
  ],
